        'Total operating expenses':{ t:'Guided to low double digits, with more advertising and marketing', h:'<p>Q3 operating expense growth guided to <b>low double digits</b>, currency-neutral and excluding acquisitions and special items, with higher advertising and marketing growth than the first half on the cadence of sponsorship spend, and a 0 to 1 point FX tailwind. A one-time restructuring charge of about <b>$190M</b> was guided for Q3 as a special item, outside the non-GAAP figures.</p>' },
