        'Switched transactions':{ t:'+11%', h:'<p>Switched transactions grew 11% (10% on an unrounded basis, per the CFO). Contactless reached 77% of in-person purchases, up 6 points, and there are 3.6 billion cards, up 6%.</p>' },
        'Domestic assessments':{ t:'+6% on GDV +9%', h:'<p>Domestic assessments grew 6% against worldwide GDV of 9%; the 3-point gap is mix. US GDV grew 7%, helped by the Wells Fargo commercial credit and Citizens debit conversions.</p>' },
